<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITON RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AFRICAN CLUB COMPETITON RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinal, second</p>
<p>leg matches in African club soccer competitions at the weekend:</p>
<p>Played Saturday:</p>
<p>Confederation of Africa Football (CAF) Cup</p>
<p>In Kinshasa: Vita Club (Zaire) 2  Etoile du Sahel (Tunisia)</p>
<p>1 (1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Vita Club - Luende Mulangana (2-penalty), Boeka Lisani (73)</p>
<p>Etoile du Sahel - Zoubir Beya (45)</p>
<p>Attendance: 60,000</p>
<p>Etoile du Sahel win 3-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>In Nairobi: Kenya Breweries (Kenya) 1 Kawkab Marrakech</p>
<p>(Morocco) 0 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: George Maina (89)</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,000.</p>
<p>Kawkab Marrakech win 4-2 on aggregate</p>
<p>Champions' Cup</p>
<p>In Ibadan: Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1 JS Kabylie (Algeria) 0</p>
<p>(0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: David Ogaga (78)</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Shooting Stars win 2-1 on aggregate</p>
</text>
